00:02:10.116 --> 00:02:13.400
- Yes. Rhythmic instruments
have existed in Japan

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.120
for around 2000 years.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.020
Drums brought in from China
were adapted into a uniquely

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:21.480
Japanese style, a style that
facilitated the practice

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:24.060
of Shinto, an indigenous
Japanese religion in which

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.200
worships, ancestors and
nature spirits through

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.670
the spiritual art form.

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:32.170
Taiko became an intimate part
of many village activities.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.980
Taiko would later become
a big part of Chai ki

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.840
or religious festivals.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.940
Every town in ancient Japan
would hold their own festivals

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:43.180
that began to incorporate
Taiko, drumming and dancing due

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:46.570
to their deep resonant
sounds, Taiko were also used

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:50.280
by the military and towns folk
as a way to deliver messages

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.880
or signals across large
distances for hundreds of years

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.986
Taiko existed in these two ways,

00:02:55.986 --> 00:02:59.201
as an essential part of
dancing at religious festivals

00:02:59.201 --> 00:03:01.770
and a communication device.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:06.370
- In 1951, a jazz drummer
named Daihachi Oguchi was

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.520
asked to play an old sheet

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.430
of Taiko music discovered in an attic when

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.568
he was finally able to interpret
the old Japanese notation.

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:16.600
He discovered that the
music was extremely simple

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:19.090
because it was written
to be played in unison.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.730
He began toying with
new, more complex ideas

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:26.260
and later realized that
different types of Taiko played

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.080
by a group of people could
be used to effectively

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.990
emulate a Western drum set.

