00:05:32.227 --> 00:05:34.940
- Various Kumi Daiko
groups were established

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.740
in the 1950s and 60s.

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:38.150
Some of these groups such

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.187
as Kodo still exist and
perform around the world today

00:05:41.187 --> 00:05:43.530
- Taiko existed prior to 1951

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.723
but the art form was completely
reinvented. since then,

00:05:46.723 --> 00:05:49.910
Kumi Daiko has spread to
all corners of the world.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.380
It became a way for Japanese Americans to

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.645
reclaim their Japanese heritage inspired

00:05:54.645 --> 00:05:57.807
by the civil rights movement in the 1960s

00:05:57.807 --> 00:06:00.150
- To connect with that part of culture.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.673
And that part of history
is important to me.

00:06:02.673 --> 00:06:07.457
