Japanese American connect

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:11.580
with that part of my heritage in Japan

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:16.580
and to be accepted as a woman
and as an American and as a

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:21.190
a Taiko player was also important

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.070
